{
  "description": "Agent handle derivation vectors, shared by Keyring and the agent-connect plugin (docs/plans/agent-connect-plan.md §3.6). Generated by an implementation independent of either.",
  "version": 1,
  "derivation": "handle = slug + '-' + suffix. slug: name lower-cased, each U+0020 space as '-', every character outside [a-z0-9-] dropped, cut to 32 characters; 'agent' if nothing is left. suffix: the first 4 characters of the lower-case, unpadded RFC 4648 base32 of SHA-256 over the UTF-8 bytes of the agent's DID string; 6 characters if the 4-character handle is in 'taken' (case-insensitive); if the 6-character one is also taken, the error 'handle-collision'.",
